        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "03ffafde-5e5d-52ab-8b18-7704a23073b6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yasuzo Masumura, Peter Glenville, Ayako Wakao, Kiyoshi Atsumi, Torajirō Kuruma\n- Organizations: Daiei Studios\n- Works: Tora-san's Shattered Romance\n- Roles: film director, film and stage actor, Madonna\n\nFacts:\n- Yasuzo Masumura was a Japanese film director who lived from August 25, 1924 to November 23, 1986.\n- Peter Glenville, born Peter Patrick Brabazon Browne, was an English film and stage actor and director who lived from October 28, 1913 to June 3, 1996.\n- In 1951, Daiei Studios contracted Ayako Wakao as part of its fifth \"New Face\" group.\n- Ayako Wakao often appeared in films directed by Yasuzo Masumura.\n- Tora-san's Shattered Romance stars Kiyoshi Atsumi as Torajirō Kuruma, also known as Tora-san.\n- In Tora-san's Shattered Romance, Ayako Wakao plays the love interest called the \"Madonna\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
